    "northStar": "Graphite Command Stations",
    "overview": "The normal match uses thin steel frames, warm metal command pictograms and original model portraits around a dominant battlefield. Dense, quiet controls support reading resources, inspecting real actor state and issuing orders. There is no decorative animation; minimap activity communicates game events.",
